        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="AA_Plasmorph"]/description</xpath>
          <value><description>A strange snail shelled in iron sulphide, carrying organs that build a weak electric spark down its length. The bezzul uses that spark to light its own flammable spit before lobbing a burning gobbet at whatever is threatening it.</description></value>
        </li>
      </operations>
