        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="AA_OvergrownColossus"]/description</xpath>
          <value><description>A six-legged, six-eyed giant that carries a small grove on its own back, the trees feeding it as much as it feeds them. Tamed, a thummorak can be trimmed for wood without ever needing to be felled.</description></value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
